#~ "minute,\n"
#~ "so more reactions succeed per unit "
#~ "time even if the barrier stays the"
#~ " same.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Obtained from E(α) via the compensation effect.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "            </div>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<div style=\"border-left: 4px solid "
#~ "#ff7f0e; padding-left: 12px; margin-"
#~ "bottom: 8px\">\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "**A(α) — Factor preexponencial**\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "La tasa a la que las moléculas "
#~ "del material intentan reaccionar, por "
